  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to justice for LGBTI persons in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to increase the protection of human rights and fundamental freedoms fo the lesbian, gay, bisexual, trans and intersex (LGBTI) persons in Serbia, Bosnia-Herzegovina, Kosovo, Montenegro, Macedonia and Albania.</narrative>
  </description>
